      "file": "Darwinbots2/MDIForm1.frm",
      "lines": "1398-1399,1780-1781,2539-2574",
      "behavior": "Both menu and toolbar invoke fittest; mode7 initializes random search weight, mode9 starts Test.txt with mutations disabled."
    },
    {
      "file": "Darwinbots2/HDRoutines.bas",
      "lines": "1033-1035",
      "behavior": "Autosaved original search mode7 becomes loaded search mode8, not testing9."
    },
    {
      "file": "Darwinbots2/Master.bas",
      "lines": "499-504",
      "behavior": "Automatic fittest runs at positive multiples of50 in modes7/8; manual commands are not cycle-gated."
    },
    {
      "file": "Darwinbots2/Evo.bas",
      "lines": "579-620,686-725",
      "behavior": "LastMut guard; new best ID1.15, same ID improved score1.75; stage archive and mode9 external restart."
